---
// A quiet in-post link to the ISO 9001 readiness check. Hairlines, no box, one
// aubergine moment on the leading rule. Rendered inside a Journal post body,
// so it sits at the prose measure rather than the full page width.
---
<aside class="rcc">
  <p class="rcc-eyebrow">ISO 9001 readiness check</p>
  <p class="rcc-line">
    Fifteen yes-or-no questions on how you run the work already. You get a score, a band, and a
    written breakdown of where your gaps are and what to do first.
  </p>
  <a class="rcc-go" href="/journal/iso-9001-readiness-check">Take the readiness check <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
</aside>

<style>
  .rcc {
    max-width: var(--read);
    margin: clamp(36px, 5vh, 56px) auto;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
    padding-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .rcc-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .rcc-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--aubergine);
    flex: none;
  }
  .rcc-line {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--body);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .rcc-go {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--slate);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .rcc-go:hover {
    opacity: 0.66;
  }
  .rcc-go .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }
  .rcc-go:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .rcc-go .arrow {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
